{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "encryption_at_rest", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585864.0932403, "final_answer": "All data stored on Northwind Cloud is encrypted at rest with AES-256 [doc:doc_encryption]. This encryption uses keys managed by the platform key service [doc:doc_encryption].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_encryption", "doc_export", "doc_sla"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585864.0932403, "latency_ms": 1739.6236999993562, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 599, "completion_tokens": 41, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_50504c49"}
{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "onboarding_api_key", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585865.8329396, "final_answer": "First, sign up with an email address and verify it by clicking the confirmation link [doc:doc_onboarding]. Second, create a project from the dashboard by choosing a name and a default region [doc:doc_onboarding]. Third, open the console and generate an API key under Settings and then Keys [doc:doc_onboarding].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_onboarding", "doc_encryption", "doc_rate_limits"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585865.8329396, "latency_ms": 5233.79869999917, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 610, "completion_tokens": 71, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_7a5160fa"}
