{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "regions_available", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585935.3631797, "final_answer": "Northwind Cloud operates three regions: us-east (Virginia), eu-west (Ireland), and ap-south (Mumbai) [doc:doc_regions].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_compliance", "doc_regions", "doc_sla"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585935.3631797, "latency_ms": 1435.1475999974355, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 600, "completion_tokens": 33, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_a8d3937a"}
{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "compliance_soc2", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585936.7983906, "final_answer": "Northwind Cloud maintains SOC 2 Type II certification [doc:doc_compliance]. This certification is renewed through an annual audit [doc:doc_compliance]. The report for this certification is available under NDA from the trust center [doc:doc_compliance].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_compliance", "doc_billing_plans", "doc_data_retention"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585936.7983906, "latency_ms": 5630.070300001535, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 609, "completion_tokens": 52, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_405915c9"}
{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "rate_limit_429", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585942.428528, "final_answer": "When the API returns HTTP 429 due to an exceeded limit, clients should retry with exponential backoff starting at 1 second, with a maximum of 5 retries [doc:doc_rate_limits]. The API response will include a Retry-After header indicating how many seconds to wait [doc:doc_rate_limits]. Retrying immediately without backoff can extend the throttle [doc:doc_rate_limits].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_rate_limits", "doc_onboarding", "doc_status_page"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585942.428528, "latency_ms": 5529.185999999754, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 620, "completion_tokens": 89, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_3d4c698e"}
{"run_id": "run_19f50827", "case_id": "sla_credit_formula", "system_config": {"top_k": 3, "min_score": 0.05, "weighting": "idf", "generator": "gemini-2.5-flash via OpenAI-compatible API", "temperature": 0.0}, "started_at": 1789585947.9577768, "final_answer": "If measured uptime falls below the target, customers can claim a service credit on the next invoice [doc:doc_sla]. The credit formula is 5% of the monthly fee for every 0.1% of downtime below the target, calculated as missed uptime divided by 0.1, multiplied by 5 [doc:doc_sla]. This credit is capped at 50% of one monthly fee [doc:doc_sla].", "retrieved_doc_ids": ["doc_sla", "doc_encryption", "doc_refunds"], "tool_calls": [], "spans": [{"kind": "generation", "name": "llm_rag_gemini-2.5-flash.invoke", "started_at": 1789585947.9577768, "latency_ms": 4710.04560000074, "attributes": {"attempt": 1}, "error": null}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 627, "completion_tokens": 91, "token_source": "api"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "tr_8a19d330"}
